      <lb/>Fautor Honoratissime</opener>

  <p><lb/>Ex quo <rs type="lostletter">literas</rs> Tuas gratissimas accepi, ne <foreign xml:lang="grc">γρὺ</foreign>
    <lb/>quidem audivi de <rs type="biblio">libris</rs> istis quos per <abbr>Dn.</abbr> <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-120813556">Joh. Christ.
      <lb/>Reinwaldum</rs> me accepturum ais. Equidem ille <del><gap/></del><add>postquam</add>
      <lb/>hic appuli<del><gap/></del><add>t</add> statim catalogum Tua ex parte mihi
      <lb/>tradidit, ipsos autem <rs type="biblio">libros</rs> cum sup<del><gap/></del><add>e</add>llectili su<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>
      <lb/>rect<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> <rs type="place" key="place_GEO-2973783">Argentinam</rs> deferri significabat, asserens se illuc
      <lb/>abiturum illos<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> mihi post adventum suum quantocyus
      <lb/>remissurum. Rogaris igitur Vir Amplissime
    <lb/>ut vel ipsum <abbr>Dn.</abbr> <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-120813556">Reinwaldum</rs> per <rs type="letter">literas</rs> exhor<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>teris, vel saltem ut <del><gap/></del>inscriptionem ejus <add>quam ex <rs type="person">cognatis</rs> rescire poteris mihi</add> com<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>munices, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> ipse illum compellare possim. Non parum
      <lb/>sollicitus sum de his <rs type="biblio">libris</rs>, vereor quippe ne publicationis
      <lb/>periculum subeant c<choice><orig><g ref="#ugrav">ù</g></orig><reg>u</reg></choice>m in <rs type="place" key="place_VER-frankr">Galli<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> territorium trans<add>vehun<choice><orig><g ref="#tur">&#xf199;</g></orig><reg>tur</reg></choice></add>.
      <lb/>Quod reliquum est Tu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>itto cur<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>, Te<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> certum velim,
    <lb/>me omnia qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> vel Tu vel <abbr>Dn.</abbr> <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-120813556">Reinwaldus</rs> pro dictis <rs type="biblio">libris</rs>
      <lb/>persolveritis su<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>a gratiarum actione redditurum; nec
      <lb/>minus <add>me</add> senties<del><gap/></del> quovis officii genere <add>et quavis occasione</add> paratissimum et </p>

